{'symbol': 'FI', 'date': '2021-07-22 17:31:00', 'title': "FRANK'S INTERNATIONAL N.V. SCHEDULES SECOND QUARTER 2021 EARNINGS RELEASE AND CONFERENCE CALL", 'text': "HOUSTON, JULY 22, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- FRANK'S INTERNATIONAL N.V. (THE “COMPANY”) (NYSE: FI) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT WILL HOST A CONFERENCE CALL TO DISCUSS ITS SECOND QUARTER 2021 RESULTS ON TUESDAY, AUGUST 3, 2021 AT 10:00 A.M. CENTRAL TIME (11:00 A.M. EASTERN TIME). THE COMPANY WILL ISSUE ITS SECOND QUARTER 2021 EARNINGS RELEASE PRIOR TO THE CONFERENCE CALL."}